    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 3-Bedroom, 3-Bathroom Duplex for Sale in Ashwood Glade (Photos are file photos and are for reference purposes only)\r\n\r\nPresenting a well maintained 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom duplex located in the highly sought-after Ashwood development withing walking distance of  Westport town centre. This bright and spacious property offers comfortable modern living, featuring generous accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated close to Westport town centre, train station, Tesco, schools, bars, restaurants, shop, and all local amenities, this property is perfect for families, first-time buyers, or investors looking for quality home in a prime location.\r\n\r\nThe property accommodation is over first and second floor and consists of:\r\nEntrance Hall,  Kitchen/Dining, Living Room with Balcony, W.C., 3 Double Bedrooms (Master en-suite), Main Bathroom and Hot press.\r\n\r\nAshwood is a beautifully developed offering over three acres with woodland, riverside walking paths and lots of green areas.  \r\n\r\nViewing strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
